                                "example_id": "e27eb6b9-9cc6-427b-8728-9b2dd4598451",
                                "sense_id": "4dd74c1f-0edf-3ebd-9ab2-675729c926e2",
                                "text": "Probably the warm, damp, \"mochy\" weather experienced at the end of September and the first few days of October is the reason for this. A week of such conditions, in which the blow-fly revels, can do much damage and cause great annoyance to the shepherd[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f4f686f-7f4c-4676-9d8d-73d8584c3e7a",
                                "sense_id": "4dd74c1f-0edf-3ebd-9ab2-675729c926e2",
                                "text": "[…] rain and close mochy weather."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5cf26e46-5556-486b-b88f-a0bf8a789d4f",
                                "sense_id": "4dd74c1f-0edf-3ebd-9ab2-675729c926e2",
                                "text": "[…] but there was rain at night and again on Sunday, which was dull all day. Tuesday was a real \"mochy\" day, with a close damp atmosphere."
